rface. eta-mu kanban --help and eta-mu kanban list --help both print only the generic banner, so the command surface was confirmed from CI and observed behaviour rather than from help output.", :note "Card prose only. No card status, uuid, owner, or other frontmatter field was changed on any card, and no board mutation was performed through eta-mu; all eta-mu use was read-only count/list/find. No audio device, native UI, waveform, FFmpeg, or publication API was exercised."}
